mikodex --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `mikodex fork`, `mikodex exec`, and `mikodex exec fork`
mikodex fork --worktree: `mikodex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
mikodex fork --worktree --last: `mikodex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
mikodex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `mikodex exec fork --worktree`
mikodex exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
mikodex resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `mikodex fork`, `mikodex exec`, and `mikodex exec fork`
mikodex archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `mikodex fork`, `mikodex exec`, and `mikodex exec fork`
mikodex queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `mikodex fork`, `mikodex exec`, and `mikodex exec fork`
